            "content": "# {project_name} — Base Specification\n\n## Purpose\n项目基础约定。此 spec 由 `se3 init` 生成，在所有 `se3 run` 流程中自动加载。\n\n## Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Project Identity\n- 项目名称: {project_name}\n- 简述: {project_description}\n- 主要语言/框架: {languages_and_frameworks}\n\n### Requirement: Directory Structure\n- {directory_structure}\n\n### Requirement: Coding Conventions\n- {coding_conventions}\n\n### Requirement: Key Constraints\n- {key_constraints}\n\n### Requirement: Workflow Conventions\n- {workflow_conventions}\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Commit Step Configuration\n\n#### Version Bumping\n\nThe commit step supports automatic version bumping before creating git commits. This ensures each completed change has a corresponding version identifier.\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `commit.version_bumping.enabled` | boolean | `false` | Enable automatic version bumping in commit step |\n| `commit.version_bumping.file_path` | string | `null` | Path to version file (auto-detected if null) |\n| `commit.version_bumping.auto_detect` | boolean | `true` | Automatically detect version file location |\n\n##### Version Bumping Rules\n\nWhen enabled, the version is bumped according to the task type:\n\n| Task Type | Bump Type | Example |\n|-----------|-----------|---------|\n| `feature` | minor | `1.2.3` → `1.3.0` |\n| `bugfix` | patch | `1.2.3` → `1.2.4` |\n| `breaking` | major | `1.2.3` → `2.0.0` |\n\n##### Supported Version File Formats\n\nThe following version file formats are automatically detected (in priority order):\n\n1. `package.json` - Node.js projects (`version` field)\n2. `pyproject.toml` - Python projects (`project.version` field)\n3. `version.py` / `__init__.py` - Python projects (`__version__` variable)\n4. `setup.py` - Python projects (`version` parameter)\n5. `Cargo.toml` - Rust projects (`package.version` field)\n6. `VERSION` / `VERSION.txt` - Plain text version files\n\n##### Example Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# se3.yaml\ncommit:\n  version_bumping:\n    enabled: true\n    file_path: null      # Auto-detect version file\n    auto_detect: true    # Search common locations\n```\n\nOr with explicit version file path:\n\n```yaml\n# se3.yaml\ncommit:\n  version_bumping:\n    enabled: true\n    file_path: \"src/my_package/__init__.py\"\n    auto_detect: false   # Use specified path only\n```\n\n##### Atomicity and Rollback\n\nVersion bumping is atomic with git commit:\n- If commit succeeds, version change is preserved\n- If commit fails, version change is automatically rolled back\n- This ensures version number always matches committed code state\n",
